 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OqzwUO8vktcQ7kNvwHQjgox&_nc_oc=AdoTyZ1F5qwm2Ctv0z25soz6A5VHg6nFdXEFlwkbNEo8v9AP6sx-o7J_ACcoMOUVRwo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTS3DC06xBTb0Jt4CfQgbYpAJR3VnNwl3LH8jze5T2f5Q&oe=6AF9CD41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Oa6Qef2_8MgQ7kNvwES9y3G&_nc_oc=Adpd0ksVZL77PFQbGmCvloAUgNUP8JrXfvUs3LfqEBefDRPcXBMOy8XT4k7sATO63zc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTsXE73L-ETfbTPsAQyQ8-S3LtACmKr6LbLZnFm0lagRA&oe=6AF9DAA6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ULfcEp4GdcQ7kNvwHTXZcv&_nc_oc=Adr675XHLkAgUgOTHy7DeTnzLjgUEyXaBBFfVDFV6NJgrczukcSZP-cP_n21Xz0wnZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQR2PnWX9briNiaSkJJjCG-iV1XNH1b5LkAPsv129n7yw&oe=6AF9E49C"}, {"fil